00:39:55,640 --> 00:40:02,240
Reading it is to enter an uncomfortable, intimate and lucid territory, where fragility becomes  

416
00:40:02,240 --> 00:40:08,800
a form of knowledge and resistance. Elena Garro is one of the most  

