00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:48,480
national myths and stories from a female perspective, questioning machismo, guilt and  

434
00:41:48,480 --> 00:41:53,880
marginalization of women in Mexican history. Garro's life was marked by exile,  

435
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:59,120
