00:43:51,960 --> 00:43:57,680
with horror and fantasy, like Mariana Enríquez in Argentina. Some renew poetry,  

457
00:43:57,680 --> 00:44:03,280
such as Elvira Sastre or Elena Medel. And many more address themes such as the body, motherhood,  

458
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:09,800
gender violence, identity or friendship, each from its own perspective. 

459
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:14,360
The most important thing is that, at this moment, Spanish literature is enriched with  

460
00:44:14,360 --> 00:44:20,560
female voices that no longer ask permission, that do not hide or conform to a place  

461
00:44:20,560 --> 00:44:25,840
secondary. They are writers who have built a solid body of work and who will undoubtedly continue to make their mark  

462
00:44:25,840 --> 00:44:31,480
the direction of literature in our language. So, in this last stretch of the journey,  

