00:45:23,600 --> 00:45:29,480
which traces the history of Chile through several generations of women. With elements  

473
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:36,160
Fantastic, unforgettable characters and a warm and enveloping prose, the novel is part of the  

474
00:45:36,160 --> 00:45:41,960
tradition of magical realism, but with its own tone, marked by the feminine perspective. 

475
00:45:41,960 --> 00:45:46,520
Throughout her career, Isabel Allende has addressed themes such as exile, dictatorship,  

476
00:45:46,520 --> 00:45:51,800
feminism, loss, love, and old age. Works such as Eva Luna, Paula,  

